(6848921, 1030520, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Now this is a treasured memory! You don''t see much of the ol'' coin-op riding horse. This definitely symbolizes childhood for many and lovely visual to complement the nursery rhyme. This could have been a good subject for the Vintage challenge that we had not too long ago. I like how you made it look like a faded photograph with the white border. Also there is some texture (overlay?) that adds to the feel of age - it projects the idea of a faded and fond memory. Nicely done (8).</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Now this is a treasured memory! You don''t see much of the ol'' coin-op riding horse. This definitely symbolizes childhood for many and lovely visual to complement the nursery rhyme. This could have been a good subject for the Vintage challenge that we had not too long ago. I like how you made it look like a faded photograph with the white border. Also there is some texture (overlay?) that adds to the feel of age - it projects the idea of a faded and fond memory. Nicely done (8).', '2012-08-25 18:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6848927, 1030703, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Was it really an outtake from the Fractals challenge? Regardless, it''s a pleasing image. Maybe brighten the center a bit.</td>', 'Lovely. Was it really an outtake from the Fractals challenge? Regardless, it''s a pleasing image. Maybe brighten the center a bit.', '2012-08-25 19:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6848928, 1030805, 62249, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept and well executed!</td>', 'Excellent concept and well executed!', '2012-08-25 19:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
