(6849179, 1030216, 60862, '<td valign="top">This image challenges me, and is an example of when I''d like to know more about what''s behind it.  I don''t get the connection among a kangaroo, a kayak, and a road, or how any of them are magical or would appear behind a magical gate.  So the story I get instead is just "random stuff behind a gate."</td>', 'This image challenges me, and is an example of when I''d like to know more about what''s behind it.  I don''t get the connection among a kangaroo, a kayak, and a road, or how any of them are magical or would appear behind a magical gate.  So the story I get instead is just "random stuff behind a gate."', '2012-08-26 12:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
