(6849186, 1030789, 60862, '<td valign="top">This really shows what someone with a vision and talent can do with expert editing.  I''d be surprised if this didn''t ribbon, and I expect it to be blue.<br/> <br/>If this isn''t Gyaban, then take the fact it makes me think of his work as a very high compliment!</td>', 'This really shows what someone with a vision and talent can do with expert editing.  I''d be surprised if this didn''t ribbon, and I expect it to be blue. If this isn''t Gyaban, then take the fact it makes me think of his work as a very high compliment!', '2012-08-26 12:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
