(6852262, 1030842, 49954, '<td valign="top">Love the expression with the tongue... like "That camera is tasty looking... as is the person holding it..."  Wish it were a little more clear.</td>', 'Love the expression with the tongue... like "That camera is tasty looking... as is the person holding it..."  Wish it were a little more clear.', '2012-08-30 08:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
