(6852279, 1030440, 49954, '<td valign="top">ewwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww.<br/> <br/>I looked at this several times and only just now saw the white mouse in the middle... the tail being front and center is a bit of a distraction (I know it''s in the rhyme)</td>', 'ewwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww. I looked at this several times and only just now saw the white mouse in the middle... the tail being front and center is a bit of a distraction (I know it''s in the rhyme)', '2012-08-30 09:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852280, 1030717, 49954, '<td valign="top">Strange.  But entered.</td>', 'Strange.  But entered.', '2012-08-30 09:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852281, 1030825, 49954, '<td valign="top">Go to mall and find a little kid sitting on a wall... Bam... Humpty Dumpty connection... not getting it other than that. Plus it''s a tad overblurred.</td>', 'Go to mall and find a little kid sitting on a wall... Bam... Humpty Dumpty connection... not getting it other than that. Plus it''s a tad overblurred.', '2012-08-30 09:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852282, 1030386, 49954, '<td valign="top">Strange... without the title hinting at Old MacDonald, it looks to me more like a giant attacking a village... Not a lot of "farm" showing and it''s a bit too surreal</td>', 'Strange... without the title hinting at Old MacDonald, it looks to me more like a giant attacking a village... Not a lot of "farm" showing and it''s a bit too surreal', '2012-08-30 09:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852283, 1030379, 49954, '<td valign="top">Snips, snails and puppy dog tails... none of which are apparent here.  It''s just a blurred photo of a boy in a spiderman shirt.    So the only connection to me is that you have a boy.</td>', 'Snips, snails and puppy dog tails... none of which are apparent here.  It''s just a blurred photo of a boy in a spiderman shirt.    So the only connection to me is that you have a boy.', '2012-08-30 09:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852286, 1030211, 49954, '<td valign="top">No mouse apparent.  The clock isn''t even at "one".  Lighting is poor as well... OH WAIT!  I just saw the white area and realize you put a computer mouse on there... hahaha  ok... perhaps he was up there for over seven hours until "down he run"....  Cute idea that could have been done a little better -- upping by 1</td>', 'No mouse apparent.  The clock isn''t even at "one".  Lighting is poor as well... OH WAIT!  I just saw the white area and realize you put a computer mouse on there... hahaha  ok... perhaps he was up there for over seven hours until "down he run"....  Cute idea that could have been done a little better -- upping by 1', '2012-08-30 09:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
