(6852332, 1030533, 11769, '<td valign="top">Solitary feeling</td>', 'Solitary feeling', '2012-08-30 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852333, 1030812, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>I really like the action of the scene - Cinderella in her white ballroom gown rushing to get away before the spell breaks. Her hair is all aflutter and she has gathered up her dress so that she can run better. We can see the one leg with the shoe - tis a shame the other is not visible so that we can see that the foot is bare. Cinderella is very prominent in the scene especially with the dynamic contrast of the white popping off the very dark backdrop. Because of the backdrop being dark and Cinderella''s flight keeping a hold on my eye''s focus, I almost missed the detail of the lost shoe in the back. I think the composition would be much stronger if her bare foot had been visible and mayhap have a bit more light to illuminate the lost shoe.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. I really like the action of the scene - Cinderella in her white ballroom gown rushing to get away before the spell breaks. Her hair is all aflutter and she has gathered up her dress so that she can run better. We can see the one leg with the shoe - tis a shame the other is not visible so that we can see that the foot is bare. Cinderella is very prominent in the scene especially with the dynamic contrast of the white popping off the very dark backdrop. Because of the backdrop being dark and Cinderella''s flight keeping a hold on my eye''s focus, I almost missed the detail of the lost shoe in the back. I think the composition would be much stronger if her bare foot had been visible and mayhap have a bit more light to illuminate the lost shoe.', '2012-08-30 10:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852336, 1030379, 11769, '<td valign="top">A journey of discovery</td>', 'A journey of discovery', '2012-08-30 10:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852337, 1030736, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wild.</td>', 'Wild.', '2012-08-30 10:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852340, 1030810, 11769, '<td valign="top">This is all I need.</td>', 'This is all I need.', '2012-08-30 10:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852341, 1030825, 11769, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. Very sad.</td>', 'Powerful image. Very sad.', '2012-08-30 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852343, 1030816, 11769, '<td valign="top">Ha!</td>', 'Ha!', '2012-08-30 10:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852349, 1030846, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Simple and clean presentation of the nursery rhyme. Love the action of the cat - he seems to be carefully opening the door and peeking out. I do have two critiques/pointers that could make this composition even stronger. I wish we could see more of his eyes for they are either partially blocked by the door or the door handle. The second is that the highlights on the door and part of the cat''s paw are very blown out causing a loss of detail. There is still a small bit of detail (some very faint beveling on the door to the left) on the doors but in many areas it looks like just a plain white backdrop.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Simple and clean presentation of the nursery rhyme. Love the action of the cat - he seems to be carefully opening the door and peeking out. I do have two critiques/pointers that could make this composition even stronger. I wish we could see more of his eyes for they are either partially blocked by the door or the door handle. The second is that the highlights on the door and part of the cat''s paw are very blown out causing a loss of detail. There is still a small bit of detail (some very faint beveling on the door to the left) on the doors but in many areas it looks like just a plain white backdrop.', '2012-08-30 10:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852405, 1030703, 63218, '<td valign="top">Woot! Gorgeous!</td>', 'Woot! Gorgeous!', '2012-08-30 12:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852407, 1030776, 63218, '<td valign="top">super duper little wild child, love it!</td>', 'super duper little wild child, love it!', '2012-08-30 12:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852408, 1030846, 63218, '<td valign="top">love that serious philosopher''s cat face...&amp; that paw!</td>', 'love that serious philosopher''s cat face...& that paw!', '2012-08-30 12:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852409, 1030386, 63218, '<td valign="top">indeed...awesome! srsly!</td>', 'indeed...awesome! srsly!', '2012-08-30 12:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
