(6852418, 1030810, 20799, '<td valign="top">First image I opened, thought of jmritz. Lovely minimalistic, 10.</td>', 'First image I opened, thought of jmritz. Lovely minimalistic, 10.', '2012-08-30 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852419, 1030851, 20799, '<td valign="top">Contagious!</td>', 'Contagious!', '2012-08-30 12:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852452, 1030771, 47316, '<td valign="top">I had to google the rhyme to see what was going on here. Would make more sense if you''d included a blackbird flying off with the nose. As it is, it''s really just a freaky shot that is really disturbing to look at. Probably doesn''t help that I''m a bit traumatized because I have seen a lady with no nose (my guess is drugs)... it was scary.</td>', 'I had to google the rhyme to see what was going on here. Would make more sense if you''d included a blackbird flying off with the nose. As it is, it''s really just a freaky shot that is really disturbing to look at. Probably doesn''t help that I''m a bit traumatized because I have seen a lady with no nose (my guess is drugs)... it was scary.', '2012-08-30 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852453, 1030612, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great example of how to use lighting.  The barely visible bits of her face tell the story well of her evil, and the brightly lit background not only silhouettes her, adding to the malevolence, but adds to the story because of the counting marks.  Well done!<br/> <br/>Back to bump to 10, partly to support your choice to enter a dark subject.</td>', 'Great example of how to use lighting.  The barely visible bits of her face tell the story well of her evil, and the brightly lit background not only silhouettes her, adding to the malevolence, but adds to the story because of the counting marks.  Well done! Back to bump to 10, partly to support your choice to enter a dark subject.', '2012-08-30 13:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852454, 1030533, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very nice job conveying the idea of a gloomy, rainy day.  The dim lighting really adds to the story, too.<br/> <br/>Back to bump to 10!</td>', 'Very nice job conveying the idea of a gloomy, rainy day.  The dim lighting really adds to the story, too. Back to bump to 10!', '2012-08-30 13:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852455, 1030717, 47316, '<td valign="top">This is rather interesting. The background texture reminds me of those 3d images you had to cross your eyes to see something pop out of. It''s a simple and understated shot, and I dig that.</td>', 'This is rather interesting. The background texture reminds me of those 3d images you had to cross your eyes to see something pop out of. It''s a simple and understated shot, and I dig that.', '2012-08-30 13:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852459, 1030216, 47316, '<td valign="top">Was trying to look up this rhyme and found themagicgate.com and got even more confused...  The sunset and colors are nice but I don''t really get the point of the gate and the items behind it. Also the horizon not lining up inside and outside the frame is a bit bothersome to the eye. I know perhaps it was meant to be a different magical land, but the landscape I think is too similar to the outside to pull that off properly.</td>', 'Was trying to look up this rhyme and found themagicgate.com and got even more confused...  The sunset and colors are nice but I don''t really get the point of the gate and the items behind it. Also the horizon not lining up inside and outside the frame is a bit bothersome to the eye. I know perhaps it was meant to be a different magical land, but the landscape I think is too similar to the outside to pull that off properly.', '2012-08-30 13:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852461, 1030531, 47316, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this. Visually very pretty. I''m not so sure I like the gradient of orange to blue being so pronounced and taking up so much of the starry sky though. I think it might be better scaled back a bit, or perhaps not there at all. Seems kind of like a sunset clashing with a night sky.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this. Visually very pretty. I''m not so sure I like the gradient of orange to blue being so pronounced and taking up so much of the starry sky though. I think it might be better scaled back a bit, or perhaps not there at all. Seems kind of like a sunset clashing with a night sky.', '2012-08-30 13:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852462, 1030612, 47316, '<td valign="top">Nursery rhymes can be rather creepy huh? Yikes!</td>', 'Nursery rhymes can be rather creepy huh? Yikes!', '2012-08-30 13:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852464, 1030776, 47316, '<td valign="top">I love this. The way her hair kinda swirls and looks like the tree leaves and she''s mid-run with the sun in her hair. Light on top, dark on the bottom. Very cool.</td>', 'I love this. The way her hair kinda swirls and looks like the tree leaves and she''s mid-run with the sun in her hair. Light on top, dark on the bottom. Very cool.', '2012-08-30 13:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852465, 1030816, 47316, '<td valign="top">:) Comical.</td>', ':) Comical.', '2012-08-30 13:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852555, 1030533, 124815, '<td valign="top">Really lovely shot of raining with puffy little clouds. And, yes, a 10 from me</td>', 'Really lovely shot of raining with puffy little clouds. And, yes, a 10 from me', '2012-08-30 15:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852607, 1030827, 92847, '<td valign="top">WOW!! Outstanding execution! Blue, for sure!</td>', 'WOW!! Outstanding execution! Blue, for sure!', '2012-08-30 18:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
