(6853329, 1030827, 121949, '<td valign="top">As usual an excellent image! You almost had me fooled this time, like I said in my comment before it sort of crossed the line into looking more like an illustration than a photograph. Usually your shots have a bit more of a photographic quality to them (although they all are a bit on the edge) After looking at the photo a bit more I decided the girl must be your wife. <br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon! I must say I am always happy to beat you every once and awhile ;)</td>', 'As usual an excellent image! You almost had me fooled this time, like I said in my comment before it sort of crossed the line into looking more like an illustration than a photograph. Usually your shots have a bit more of a photographic quality to them (although they all are a bit on the edge) After looking at the photo a bit more I decided the girl must be your wife.  Congrats on your ribbon! I must say I am always happy to beat you every once and awhile ;)', '2012-08-31 13:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
