(6853371, 1030827, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sjhuls:</b></div><hr/><i> it sort of crossed the line into looking more like an illustration than a photograph. Usually your shots have a bit more of a photographic quality to them </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comment Jennifer. You may be mistaken about my goal, though: I don''t really try to stay in a given category. It''s nothing I think of in advance: what I want is transfer my ideas and thoughts on the screen, in order to share them and hopefully use them as a way to communicate with people. Since I''m awful at drawing or painting, I use a camera instead of a brush, but that''s the whole story. Sometimes it looks more like a photography, sometimes much less, but it''s not a problem to me since I''m not trying to document reality. Many do that much better than I would ever do anyway! Everyone can express himself in a personal way, I suppose.</td>', 'Originally posted by sjhuls: it sort of crossed the line into looking more like an illustration than a photograph. Usually your shots have a bit more of a photographic quality to them   Thanks for your comment Jennifer. You may be mistaken about my goal, though: I don''t really try to stay in a given category. It''s nothing I think of in advance: what I want is transfer my ideas and thoughts on the screen, in order to share them and hopefully use them as a way to communicate with people. Since I''m awful at drawing or painting, I use a camera instead of a brush, but that''s the whole story. Sometimes it looks more like a photography, sometimes much less, but it''s not a problem to me since I''m not trying to document reality. Many do that much better than I would ever do anyway! Everyone can express himself in a personal way, I suppose.', '2012-08-31 15:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6853406, 1030805, 131871, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red and PB. :) I do very much love the creativity here. Very outside the box. LOVE it!! I do agree with one comment below on the lighting. The lighting of Bo Peep and the rest of the photo is a bit off. I also figured it was the studio lights. But other than that, stellar idea!</td>', 'Congrats on the red and PB. :) I do very much love the creativity here. Very outside the box. LOVE it!! I do agree with one comment below on the lighting. The lighting of Bo Peep and the rest of the photo is a bit off. I also figured it was the studio lights. But other than that, stellar idea!', '2012-08-31 17:02:32.000000', NULL, 0),
